<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$3 bln NCDs on Thursday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$3 bln NCDs on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank said on Thursday it would issue T$3 billion in three-month negotiable certificates of deposit later in the day.</p>
<p>Bids would close at 15.00 local time (0700 GMT), a central bank official said.  </p>
<p>The central bank has said its recent series of NCD issues aimed to absorb banking system's extra money, but not to dampen stock market turnover as many analysts have asserted.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
